  "slug": "noweatherskip",
  "title": "NoWeatherSkip",
  "description": "Don't have enough rain or snow in your world because sleeping skips it? Keep it with this mod.",
  "body": "![NoWeatherSkip](https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihaXNs1ncFDtpUK37UgyBuPFVyO8ROCrfPEpmDn6PYpLUk_MYfttJuGJx2V5MGFC0hUOxvZDNmKyCRb9tGqi5CZXmJCj39R9AA=s1600-rw-v1?auditContext=forDisplay)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b60c288831e32653134258b230bb1f266d094a0f.png\" alt=\"About\" width=\"300\">\n</p>\n\nIn Minecraft, sleeping always skips rain and snow. **NoWeatherSkip** changes this. Now, when players sleep, rain and snow remain and change naturally afterward, but thunder changes to a less dangerous variant.\n\n---\n\n<center>  \n  <a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/mars_team\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2790d549f708e4c82ef641eb22ee125a31652f59.png\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee link\" width=\"230\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/MARSTeamMC/NoWeatherSkip\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4aa7b71db7546baed1efdca321de9ebd3586629b.png\" alt=\"GitHub link\" width=\"251\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/bYXrZ7aQWn\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2880575df25f9221da8c5f18fc06b9546277f3c6.png\" alt=\"Discord link\" width=\"265\">\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n---\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0f8774acc14c6781d49202630c4c7bebad1a0e4.png\" alt=\"Features\" width=\"350\">\n</p>\n\n- Time until the end of weather is now preserved after sleeping.\n- Sleeping during thunder changes it to rain or snow (depending on the biome) with the same time until the end.\n\n---\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/MARSTeamMC/Image2Banners\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYBlUn14n-cd_-4JD2zKYhxZOkgcHKojbxjWxNSj59aRH4p70Q6Vdhw3Fwc-hPoWkjtwbOBIRKWKNXQ6kkbL-PJhmE2-dugP98=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"Image2Banners\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/noweatherskip\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYbkTUucRbKv9eOiQkjufEwJlMJVcfCxRdSY6x883WCkUw_wPuETrzY-g_NcyV86y-PubQdd4CdPREK4m_EZLxApj0cPWWwwoU=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"NoWeatherSkip\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/instantbreak\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihYmK_0eDBaNg97m-lzfDAvYI-VyWGp08VN63SQ8Sqi6xHSyd01Smv8Tb9mQQh3v0ngWeg-iqJyeuMJXY91H0calTIlRaXGNKGE=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"InstantBreak\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/notfullybroken\">\n    <img src=\"https://drive.google.com/u/0/drive-viewer/AKGpihZhH5g_CL3wr0On88aRteML-i5PGOpe4g20QrMDxj2mQXqFc9nnMAK_-9-Vt6Zhjtvvlbi_I_d2eHeTh1g3AMBdKI8fTy1RWA=s2560?auditContext=forDisplay\" alt=\"NotFullyBroken\" width=\"434\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n---\n<center>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This project is licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License.</p>\n<p>Developed by the MARS Team MC.</p>\n</center>\n",
